  message: "Scaffold note 2026-10-16: the Lit scaffold in packages/htrac-frontend is being removed (owner decision; see WI-popal). This view starts from a fresh React scaffold (Vite + React), since BlockNote, @xyflow/react and Excalidraw are all React; the old ws-client.ts / service worker are recoverable from git history if useful."  # 67a5
