  nonce: '2e76'  # 2e76
  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f. ADR-0019 (amended) and ADR-0062 (2026-10-29) name WI-kinab as the planned @xyflow/react view, so the item is re-scoped, not obsolete. packages/htrac-frontend was removed in 86cb7d3a37, so the title prefix and 'in packages/htrac-frontend' are stale. The rest matches ADR-0062: isbefore and parent are projected as op-only plain values (section 1), and awareness carries item_id (section 4), so highlights are possible. Item D is WI-vojil (todo_hard); WI-sunan and WI-vojil are isbefore predecessors. MECHANISM: the view was specced against the removed packages/htrac-frontend scaffold; its data and awareness needs match ADR-0062. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-fujus."  # 2e76
